spans.s:
आ-√ मृज् P. -मृजति, to wipe away or off;
to rub, clean, MBh.; Śak.; BhP. &c.:
Intens. (p. -म॑र्मृजत्, RV. x, 26, 6) to smooth, polish, clean.

आ-√ मृद् P. -मृद्नाति, to crush by rubbing;
to crumple;
to mix together, R.; Suśr.

आ-√ मृश् P. -मृशति, to touch, MBh.; Śiś.;
to touch, taste, enjoy (a woman);
to consider, reflect upon, MBh.; Śak.; Kum.;
 (p. -मृशत्) to rub off, wipe away, remove, Śiś. vi, 3 :
Pass. -मृश्यते, to be eaten, Ragh. v, 9 [Mall. भक्ष्यते] :
Caus. -मर्शयति, to consider, reflect upon.
